-  the phone is driven unattended.
+  Started by PlatformBootManagerAfterConsole when the boot image carries an
+  "XNUP" payload with a "loader.efi" entry; falls back to
+  PlatformBootManagerUnableToBoot, where there is nothing else to boot.
+  Collects what the real loader will need (exception level, CPU feature
